==Faroese==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|non|fo}} {{term|hvíla|lang=non}}, akin to Gothic {{term|𐍈𐌴𐌹𐌻𐌰𐌽|sc=Goth|tr=ƕeilan||to pause, cease}}, from Gothic {{term|𐍈𐌴𐌹𐌻𐌰|sc=Goth|tr=ƕeila||hour}}, akin to Old High German {{term|hwila}} (or {{term|wila}} or {{term|hwil}}), a while (German {{term|Weile}}).

===Verb===
'''hvíla'''

# to [[rest]]

====Conjugation====
{{fo-conj-1|hvíl}}

